    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ROYAL DUTCH AIRLINES\nTIMETABLE OF WORLD-WIDE SERVICES\nVALID UNTIL OCT. 6, 1957\nKLM\nROYAL DUTCH\nAIRLINES\nWORLD'S FIRST AIRLINE",
      "Over the Atlantic -to all the World...\nIT'S A TREAT TO GO DUTCH\nKLM Royal Dutch, of course! Wherever you fly KLM... to Europe\nor any other continent, you are welcomed aboard with the same warm\nfriendliness. You experience the hospitality that has been traditional with the\nDutch for centuries and is inherent in KLM today. This also holds true\nfor any of KLM's 187 offices around the world, where English-speaking\npersonnel take a personal interest in serving you ... helping to make your trip\nall enjoyment. Fly KLM. You'll agree, \"It's a Treat To Go Dutch.\"\nNorlds\nFirst Airline\nKLM\nROYAL DUTCH\nAIRLINES"
    ],
